msgstr "Isso é\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H|1\\rangle= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\\\n"
"1 & -1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\\\n"
"-1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0.707 \\\\\\\n"
"-0.707\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle) = |-\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H|1\\rangle= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\\\n"
"1 & -1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\\\n"
"-1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0.707 \\\\\\\n"
"-0.707\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle) = |-\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Applying the $H$ gate on $|1\\rangle$ results in an equal superposition of $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$, but the sign of $|1\\rangle$ is negative.\n"
msgstr "Aplicar a porta $H$ em $|1\\rangle$ resulta numa superposição igual de $|0\\rangle$ e $|1\\rangle$, mas o sinal de $|1\\rangle$ é negativo.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.2 Single-qubit quantum state and unitary evolution {#32-single-qubit-quantum-state-and-unitary-evolution}"
msgstr "3.2 Estado quântico de qubit único e evolução unitária {#32-single-qubit-quantum-state-and-unitary-evolution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The actions of all the gates we have seen so far have been *unitary*, which means they can be represented by a unitary operator. In other words, the output state can be obtained by acting on the initial state with a unitary matrix:\n"
msgstr "As ações de todas as portas que vimos até agora são *unitárias*, o que significa que podem ser representadas por um operador unitário. Em outras palavras, o estado de saída pode ser obtido atuando no estado inicial com uma matriz unitária:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi^{'}\\rangle = U|\\psi\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi^{'}\\rangle = U|\\psi\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A unitary matrix is a matrix satisfying\n"
msgstr "Uma matriz unitária é uma matriz que satisfaz\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger}U =U U^{\\dagger} = I.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{\\dagger}U =U U^{\\dagger} = I.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In terms of quantum computer operation, we would say that applying a quantum gate to the qubit evolves the quantum state. Common single-qubit gates include the following.\n"
msgstr "Em termos de operação de computador quântico, diríamos que aplicar uma porta quântica ao qubit faz o estado quântico evoluir. As portas de qubit único mais comuns incluem as seguintes.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli gates:\n"
msgstr "Portas de Pauli:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"X = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= |0\\rangle \\langle 1|+|1\\rangle \\langle 0|\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"X = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= |0\\rangle \\langle 1|+|1\\rangle \\langle 0|\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Y = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & -i \\\\\n"
"i & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= -i|0\\rangle \\langle 1|+i|1\\rangle \\langle 0|\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Y = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & -i \\\\\n"
"i & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= -i|0\\rangle \\langle 1|+i|1\\rangle \\langle 0|\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"Z = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= |0\\rangle \\langle 0|-|1\\rangle \\langle 1|\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"Z = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= |0\\rangle \\langle 0|-|1\\rangle \\langle 1|\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the outer product was calculated as follows:\n"
"$$\n"
"|0\\rangle \\langle 0|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"|1\\rangle \\langle 0|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"onde o produto externo foi calculado da seguinte forma:\n"
"$$\n"
"|0\\rangle \\langle 0|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"|1\\rangle \\langle 0|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|0\\rangle \\langle 1|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"|1\\rangle \\langle 1|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|0\\rangle \\langle 1|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"0\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"|1\\rangle \\langle 1|=\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Other typical single-qubit gates:\n"
"$$\n"
"H= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix},\\quad\n"
"S = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"T = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & exp(i\\pi/4) \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Outras portas típicas de qubit único:\n"
"$$\n"
"H= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix},\\quad\n"
"S = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & i \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}, \\quad\n"
"T = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & exp(i\\pi/4) \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"R_x(\\theta) = e^{-i\\theta X/2} = cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}I - i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2}X = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} &  -i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"-i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} & cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"R_x(\\theta) = e^{-i\\theta X/2} = cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}I - i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2}X = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} &  -i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"-i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} & cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta) = e^{-i\\theta Y/2} = cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}I - i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2}Y = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} &  - sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} & cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"R_y(\\theta) = e^{-i\\theta Y/2} = cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}I - i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2}Y = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} &  - sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} & cos\\frac{\\theta}{2} \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"R_z(\\theta) = e^{-i\\theta Z/2} = cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}I - i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2}Z = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
"e^{-i\\theta /2} &  0 \\\\\n"
"0 & e^{i\\theta /2} \\\\\n"
"\\end{bmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"R_z(\\theta) = e^{-i\\theta Z/2} = cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}I - i sin \\frac{\\theta}{2}Z = \\begin{bmatrix}\n"
